[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5940.55, "timestamp": "01:39:00", "text": "呃，你知道谁还记得这件事吗？ 在我推出这个新模型之前，我最后一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5943.669, "timestamp": "01:39:03", "text": "直播了旧模型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5948.709, "timestamp": "01:39:08", "text": "前一天下着雨，我像个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5951.43, "timestamp": "01:39:11", "text": "孩子一样在雨中玩耍，把自己淋得浑身"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.43, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "湿透。 这是滑梯之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5960.229, "timestamp": "01:39:20", "text": "这边全是泥水。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5964.07, "timestamp": "01:39:24", "text": "你可以看到深度很合适。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5967.75, "timestamp": "01:39:27", "text": "。 我来到这里，然后摔倒在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5971.83, "timestamp": "01:39:31", "text": "滑梯摔到那边去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5975.99, "timestamp": "01:39:35", "text": "等等，我们找到一把枪。 我勒个去？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5977.99, "timestamp": "01:39:37", "text": "等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5983.99, "timestamp": "01:39:43", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5987.91, "timestamp": "01:39:47", "text": "等等，是不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5989.83, "timestamp": "01:39:49", "text": "有人把枪放在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5999.43, "timestamp": "01:39:59", "text": "兄弟。 兄弟，我们有枪。 那不是"}]